  "place": "leads the bat colony in the caves under the Wolds; comes out in the first dark",
  "_doc": "Stream E (M2). A bat lord with a voice that hurts. Its screech rings outward, it strafes lines over the group, and it hangs a sound mark on a player that bursts on whoever is near them — the marked must run off alone. At half health the colony pours out.",
  "party": {
    "solo": "Solo-able.",
    "small": "Easy.",
